Hermit":"星隱士 — 最長嘅上漲","nat.loading":"載入中…","nat.boardUnavailable":"而家讀唔到星隱士板。","nat.lobbyOffline":"以嘉賓身份玩 — 共享屏幕 2P 可以隨時隨地使用。","Force the corners, own the center.":"逼角，擁有中心。","Lesson 1 — Move":"第一課 — 搬","Slide your paddle left and right.":"左右滑動你嘅桨。","Move your paddle toward the left wall. Drag, use ← →, or tap the left side.":"將你嘅桨向左邊牆方向移動。拖曳，用 ← → ，或者㩒一下左邊。","Your paddle is the bright bar on your goal line.":"你嘅桨係你入球線上嘅明亮棒。","Now move it toward the right wall.":"而家將佢移去右邊牆。","The paddle follows your pointer or arrow keys.":"桨跟住你嘅指針或者箭頭鍵。","Lesson 2 — Serve":"第二課 — 服務","Put the ball in play.":"將波放入比賽。","The ball is yours. Press Space, tap the ball, or use the Serve button.":"個波係你嘅。撳空格，撳個波，或者用送餐掣。","Serving sends the ball toward the far goal line.":"發球將球送向遠球門線。","Lesson 3 — Return":"第三課 — 返嚟","Meet the ball with your paddle.":"用你嘅桨去迎接個波。","Return the ball once. Get your paddle under it before it crosses your line.":"回波一次。喺桨過你嘅線之前，將你嘅桨放喺佢下面","Watch the trail — meet the ball, don’t chase it.":"睇住條蹤跡 — 迎接個波，唔好追佢。","Lesson 4 — Angle":"第四課 — 角度","Strike off-center to bend your return.":"偏離中心攻擊，令你嘅背部彎曲。","Hit the ball with the outer half of your paddle to send it wide.":"用你個桨嘅外半部分打個波，將個波送闊。","Edge hits bend the return; center hits go straight.":"邊緣撞到彎曲返嚟；中心命中會直行。","Lesson 5 — Score & Win":"第五課 — 得分同贏","Score through the far goal line to win.":"穿過遠球門線得分贏。","Score one point — send the ball past the far paddle, over the far line.":"得一分 — 將波送過遠桨，過遠線。","Angled returns are harder to catch.":"斜角回球更難接。","Finish it — win the match.":"完成啦 — 贏咗個比賽。","First point wins this one.":"第一分贏呢個。","First Contact":"首次接觸","Learn the arena. First to 3, slow ball.":"學競技場。第一至三，慢波。","Ignition":"點火","Return Form":"退貨表格","Hold your ground and return cleanly.":"堅持你嘅立場，然後乾淨噉返嚟。","Wide Guard":"廣守","A wider arena demands anticipation.":"一個更寬嘅競技場需要預判。","Edge Work":"邊緣工作","Use the paddle edge to bend returns.":"用桨邊緣彎曲返回。","Tempo":"速度","The ball gains pace with every hit.":"個波隨住每一次擊中而加快速度。","Pressure Line":"壓力線","Opponent tracks faster. Stay calm.":"對手追蹤得更快。保持冷靜。","Ignition Trial":"點火試驗","Prove the basics under margin rules.":"證明保證金規則下嘅基本知識。","Mastery: Ignition":"掌握：點火","Mastery stage — win by 3 against Glide.":"精通階段 — 對滑行以 3 分勝出。","Angles":"角度","Slice":"切片","Sharper returns, sharper angles.":"返回更銳利，角度更銳利。","Narrow Margin":"毫釐之差","A slimmer paddle, a slimmer path.":"一個更細嘅槳，一條更窄嘅路。","Long Court":"長球場","A longer court rewards deep angles.":"一個更長嘅球場獎勵深角度。","Quickstep":"快步","Faster exchanges. Read the rebound.":"更快嘅交換。睇下個反彈。","Corner Trap":"角落陷阱","Angles Gate":"角度之門","Win with pace against Flow.":"以步伐對戰流贏。","First Bumper":"第一個保險杠","A single deflector changes the map.":"一個單一嘅偏轉器就可以改變成張地圖。","Bumpers":"彈 bumper","Mastery: Angles":"精通：角度","Mastery stage — angled returns, no cheap points.":"精通階段 — 有角度回報，冇平分。","Twin Deflectors":"雙偏轉器","Two bumpers guard the middle.":"兩個保險板守住中間。","Offset Lanes":"錯開車道","Asymmetric deflectors. Re-read every rebound.":"非對稱反射器。每次反彈都要重新睇過。","Pinball":"彈弓","Four deflectors. Chaos is a pattern.":"四個偏轉器。混亂係一個模式。","Bumper Trial":"緩衝試煉","Hold the line amid deflections.":"喺偏轉嘅情況下保持條線。","Crosswind":"側風","A moving blocker sweeps mid-court.":"一個移動嘅阻擋者喺中場掃過。","Double Sweep":"雙掃","Two blockers, alternating pressure.":"兩個阻斷劑，交替壓力。","Crossfire":"交叉火力","Crossfire Gate":"交叉火閘","Survive the sweep against Surge.":"喺對抗浪潮嘅掃地中幸存下來。","Mastery: Crossfire":"精通：交火","Mastery stage — blockers and margin pressure.":"掌握階段 — 阻斷劑同邊際壓力。","Overdrive":"超頻","The pace climbs. So do you.":"步伐上升。你都係。","Razor":"剃刀","Slim paddle, full speed.":"纖薄桨，全速。","Deep Court":"深層球場","The longest court at full pace.":"全速最長嘅球場。","Reactor":"反應堆","Deflectors at overdrive pace.":"超頻節奏嘅偏轉器。","Blitz":"閃電戰","Short target, sudden pressure.":"目標短，壓力突然。","Ion Storm":"離子風暴","Blockers sweep a fast court.":"障礙物掃過快速場地。","Overdrive Gate":"超頻閘門","Hold pace against Pulse.":"對住脈衝保持步伐。","Mastery: Overdrive":"精通：超速","Mastery stage — full speed, win by 3.":"精通階段 — 全速，贏 3 。","Zenith Approach":"天頂接近","The final chapter opens at pace.":"最後一章以節奏開啟。","Mirror Maze":"鏡子迷宮","Symmetric deflectors, asymmetric outcomes.":"對稱偏轉器，非對稱結果。","Swept Court":"掃過嘅法庭","Everything moves. Including you.":"一切都動。包括你。","Thin Ice":"薄冰","Slim paddle against the best tracker.":"瘦桨對抗最好嘅追蹤器。","Mastery":"精通","Full Court Press":"全庭出版社","A wide court, a fast ball, no excuses.":"一個寬敞嘅球場，一個快嘅球，冇藉口。","Chaos Theory":"混沌理論","Every mechanic, one arena.":"每個機械人，一個競技場。","The Long Rally":"長集會","A marathon to seven against Zenith.":"一場對住Zenith嘅七局馬拉松。","Mastery: Zenith":"精通：天頂","Final mastery — everything combined, win by 3.":"最終掌握 — 所有嘢加埋一齊，贏3。","Economy of Motion":"運動經濟學","Win 5–2 or better using at most 40 paddle commands. Every move counts.":"最多用40個桨指令贏5-2或更好。每一個動作都好重要。","Overclocked":"超頻","The ball never drops below 22 units/s. Survive to 5.":"個波永遠唔會跌到低過22個單位/秒。生存到5歲。","Pinball Alley":"彈珠巷","Six deflectors own the court. First to 6 in the chaos.":"六個偏轉者擁有球場。混亂中第一至六。","Toothpick":"牙籤","Restricted tools: your paddle is a sliver. Win anyway.":"受限制嘅工具：你嘅桨係一條條。點都要贏。","Sudden Death":"突然死亡","One point decides it. Full pace. No margin for error.":"一點就可以決定啦。全步伐。 No margin for error.","The Gauntlet":"嚴峻考驗","Blockers, bumpers, a slim paddle, and a relentless opponent. Win by 3.":"障礙物、彈 bumper、窄拍同一個唔肯停嘅對手。贏3分。","Calm":"平靜","Steady":"穩定","Brisk":"輕快","Fierce":"激烈","Zenith":"頂峰","Standard":"標準","Quickfire":"快火","Deflector":"偏轉器","Sweep":"掃一掃","Slimline":"纖薄","Marathon":"馬拉松","First Light":"第一道曙光","Win your first match.":"贏得你嘅第一場比賽。","Angle Master":"角度大師","Land 50 angled returns (outer-half paddle hits).":"落地50角度回波（外半部桨擊中）。","Five Alive":"五個活住","Win 5 matches in a row.":"連續贏 5 場比賽。","Mastery Track":"精通進程","Clear every Mastery stage in Journey.":"通過旅程中每一個精通關卡。","Centurion":"百夫長","Complete 100 matches, any mode.":"完成 100 場對局，任何模式。","Daily Devotee":"每日虔誠者","Finish 7 daily challenges.":"完成 7 個每日挑戰。","Half the Horizon":"半個地平線","Clear 20 Journey stages.":"通過 20 個旅程關卡。","Full Circuit":"全電路","Clear all 40 Journey stages.":"通過所有 40 個旅程關卡。","Untouchable":"無法觸及","Win a match without conceding a single point.":"贏一場比賽冇失一分。","Challenge Accepted":"接受挑戰","Clear all six Challenges.":"通過全部六個挑戰。"}
